  "question": "Since the BikerBed comes with a free mattress, how thick is it?"
}

{
  "answerable": true,
  "answer": "Just to clear one thing up first: the BikerBed doesn't come with a mattress. It's sold separately, and you can buy one alongside your BikerBed. Our mattress set (Version 2, \u00a3300) is 10cm thick firm memory foam, with removable, washable covers. It comes in three pieces: two short sections (120x50cm) and one long section (120x90cm). Paired with the BikerBed, you can set it up as either a bed or a sofa.",
